MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d56cce9b854dbe4eb4d220d3699184f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Plot_C0_S1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Client::PlotConfig
  chapterId: 0
  sceneId: 1
  nodes:
  - type: 4
    text: 
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 2
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: Endless war has bled the realm dry, and a brutal ambush just slaughtered half your squad. Though unarmed, you—Tactician Varek—refuse to flee.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: bg_c0_ambush
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: At death's door, the Heavenly Eye opens above, freezing the falling blades. It offers a Pact: command time itself in exchange for ending this war.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: bg_c0_heavenly_eye
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: You accept the oath and awaken as a Pactkeeper. From the sky above, your gaze now halts time at critical moments to issue absolute commands.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: bg_c0_pactkeeper_awaken
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: Your surviving vanguard, Commander Reinhardt, rallies beside you against the remaining ambushers. Open the Heavenly Eye—it is time to test your newfound power!
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: bg_c0_reinhardt_briefing
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: Commander Reinhardt here—stay sharp, Varek! Shift your gaze through the Heavenly Eye using W, A, S, D and the Mouse Wheel to survey the ambush.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: Watch the Ready Bar above. The instant our Assassin reaches Step 0, the Heavenly Eye freezes time and awaits your telepathic command.
    tutorialTargetId: OwnedReadyBar
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Select our Assassin on the Ready Bar to link your mind with hers.
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: See that glowing Heavenly Eye icon? Time is completely frozen—while the Eye stays open, you may plan and issue commands freely.
    tutorialTargetId: YourEye
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 3
    text: Move our Assassin into an L-shaped flanking stance at (0, -1) to stay out of the ambusher's direct line of attack.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: -1}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm her movement command.
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 1.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Movement is Instant, so your turn remains active—but rushing in now wastes SP and exposes her to a lethal counterattack. Press Wait to hold position and bait the enemy forward!
    tutorialTargetId: WaitButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 1
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 4
    text: 
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 7
    targetWaitTimeout: 15
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: The cautious ambusher held his ground too. Through the Heavenly Eye's foresight, let us check if our blade can reach him from here.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Select our Assassin again at Step 0.
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 2
    text: Right-click her Weapon Skill (Dagger Thrust) to inspect its attack range and SP cost.
    tutorialTargetId: WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: "The Heavenly Eye reveals the truth: Dagger Thrust only strikes 1 tile ahead. The enemy at (1, 0) stands completely outside our reach."
    tutorialTargetId: InspectPanel
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Click Cancel to close the Inspect panel.
    tutorialTargetId: CancelButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Swinging now would waste SP on thin air and leave our Assassin defenseless. Press Wait to conserve SP and lure the enemy straight into our kill zone!
    tutorialTargetId: WaitButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 5
    text: Patience wins wars, Varek—the enemy took the bait! As my heavy vanguard reinforces the line, prepare to strike in the next Instant.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
